%% MUPP-080 Choose families
%% What a visitor sees on the start page and Secret Santa depends on the families that exist and on the cookie.
flowchart TD
    A[Visitor opens the start page or Secret Santa] --> B{Two or more families?}
    B -- no --> C[Everything shown as before - R2]
    B -- yes --> D{Valid choice in the cookie?}
    D -- no --> E[Card: Vilken familj tillhör du? - R2]
    E --> F[Dialog Välj familj]
    D -- yes --> G[Only the chosen families' children and Secret Santa - R3 R4]
    G --> H[Button Familj at the top left - R6]
    H --> F
    F --> I{Alla or at least one family?}
    I -- no --> J[Message, nothing saved]
    J --> F
    I -- yes --> K[Cookie saved, pages shown again - R1 R6]
    K --> G
    G --> L[Secret Santa always listed, also one - R5]
